{"4751270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KUMANO", "steam_appid": 4751270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/3742d08c208e175ebd7778a9f675879d.poster.avif?t=1780201761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/3742d08c208e175ebd7778a9f675879d.webm?t=1780201761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/3742d08c208e175ebd7778a9f675879d.mp4?t=1780201761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>3D narrative adventure</strong> where you walk through the city, talk with its residents, and move the story forward through your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Third District, an abandoned city.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character wakes up there with no memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/92cfe5bfa33e7a0d3749930b73f40888.poster.avif?t=1780201761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/92cfe5bfa33e7a0d3749930b73f40888.webm?t=1780201761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/92cfe5bfa33e7a0d3749930b73f40888.mp4?t=1780201761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players explore the 3D city, meet its residents, talk with them, and progress through the story by choosing <strong>YES</strong> or <strong>NO</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even in the same places, the conversations and events you encounter will gradually change depending on when you visit, what items you have, and the choices you have made so far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your accumulated actions will determine how the story ends.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What You Do</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Walk</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely explore Third District and take in the atmosphere of the city and the everyday lives of its residents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose where to go, talk with the residents, and discover events that change depending on your items and choices.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is either <strong>YES</strong> or <strong>NO</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These small choices, accumulated over time, will slowly change the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/98778c6ec80850bf286f9867ea56321a.poster.avif?t=1780201761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/98778c6ec80850bf286f9867ea56321a.webm?t=1780201761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/98778c6ec80850bf286f9867ea56321a.mp4?t=1780201761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4751270/extras/b7ea949e625d2402154a7db951db8975.poster.avif?t=1780201761\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.